    "title": "MyScoutee email-sending",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Typed calls to the existing EmailSending owner. Native validation, queries, state transitions and scheduler behavior retained. REAL/DEMO and explicit job scope; no-store. 2 MiB request / 8 MiB response bounds; no automatic retries."
  },
